'' A 'var' inferred from a narrow string source is a STRING, not an untyped slot.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/var-infer-zstring.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered

'' The slot has a type at all -- it was 'local void s4' before, which the emitter cannot
'' allocate. A var-len string is a 24-byte descriptor here.
'' EXPECT-NOT: local void
'' EXPECT-OUT: local agg s4 size 24

'' Built and RUN against fbc on this source: both print 'fOObAR   abc'.
'' GOLDEN: expected/var-infer-zstring.out
